# Gym Application — React Frontend Architecture Proposal

Based on a thorough analysis of the BRD, here is a comprehensive frontend architecture designed for **scalability, multi-tenancy, role-based access, and future mobile expansion**.

---

## 1. Technology Stack

| Layer | Choice | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| **Framework** | React 18+ with Vite | Fast builds, modern DX, Vercel-ready |
| **Language** | TypeScript | Type safety across a large domain model |
| **Routing** | React Router v7 | Nested layouts, route guards, lazy loading |
| **State Management** | Zustand (global) + React Query/TanStack Query (server) | Zustand for auth/UI state; TanStack Query for all API data caching, pagination, mutations |
| **Forms** | React Hook Form + Zod | Performant forms with schema-based validation |
| **UI Library** | Shadcn/ui (Radix + Tailwind) | Accessible, composable, themeable component primitives |
| **Styling** | Tailwind CSS v4 | Utility-first, design-token friendly, consistent theming |
| **Charts** | Recharts | Lightweight, React-native charting for dashboard analytics |
| **Tables** | TanStack Table v8 | Headless, supports sorting, filtering, pagination |
| **Export** | jsPDF + SheetJS (xlsx) | PDF and Excel report exports |
| **HTTP Client** | Axios | Interceptors for auth tokens, tenant headers, error handling |
| **Notifications** | React Hot Toast / Sonner | Lightweight toast notifications |
| **Date Handling** | date-fns | Tree-shakeable, timezone-aware date utilities |
| **Icons** | Lucide React | Clean, consistent icon set |

---

